{"translation":{"id":"lif_wbt","name":"ᤏᤡᤱᤘᤠ᤹ᤑᤢ ᤐᤠ᤺ᤴᤈᤠᤰ ᤁᤢᤛᤱ ᤔᤠᤱᤜᤢᤵ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=lifNT","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=lifNT","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"WBT","englishName":"Limbu NT (Limbu Script)","language":"lif","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"6116919e88a76086a83bb2f30e555928fb0b93d877561f10c5d7384878062fd6","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/lif_wbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":27,"totalNumberOfChapters":260,"totalNumberOfVerses":7875,"languageName":"Limbu","languageEnglishName":"Limbu"},"book":{"id":"REV","translationId":"lif_wbt","name":"ᤛᤢᤑᤥ","commonName":"ᤛᤢᤑᤥ","title":"ᤕᤢᤜᤢᤴᤏᤠᤖᤧ ᤏᤡ᤺ᤛᤢᤒᤠ ᤛᤢᤑᤥ","order":66,"numberOfChapters":22,"sha256":"fecd46133e75bd47eb645280f500eb8d9e0cf837315af00323d1027d84fbb837","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/lif_wbt/REV/1.json","lastChapterNumber":22,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/lif_wbt/REV/22.json","totalNumberOfVerses":404},"chapter":{"number":18,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ᤒᤧᤒᤡᤗᤥᤏ ᤕᤧᤰᤕᤰᤁᤡᤴ ᤔᤧᤰ"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["ᤂᤧᤴ ᤀᤣᤃᤠᤱ ᤀᤡᤱᤃᤠ᤹ ᤛᤠᤱᤃᤪᤠᤶᤐᤣᤍᤠᤱᤗᤠᤶ ᤐᤕᤶ ᤕᤶᤒᤠ ᤕᤢᤰᤛᤠᤒᤠ ᤘᤣ᤹ᤛ᤻ᤔᤠ ᤔᤠᤱᤗᤠᤀᤡᤱᤒᤠᤎᤡᤰ ᤕᤧ᤺ᤖ ᤐᤳᤇᤧᤒᤠ ᤏᤡ᤺ᤛᤢᤱᤗᤥ॥ ᤂᤧᤸᤗᤧ ᤁᤢᤔᤡᤔᤡᤍᤡᤱᤅᤡᤸᤗᤧ ᤀᤡᤰᤛᤠᤍᤡᤱ ᤂᤠᤶᤒᤣ᤺ᤰᤔᤠᤴ ᤌᤥ᤹ᤖᤢᤖᤥ॥"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["ᤜᤧᤰᤁᤩᤠᤱ ᤂᤧᤸᤗᤧ ᤐᤕᤶ ᤕᤶᤒᤠ ᤀᤡᤰᤗᤠᤀᤥ ᤀᤰᤂᤣᤗ᤹ᤖᤡᤰ ᤐᤠ᤺ᤳᤋᤢᤖ ᤀ᤺ᤰᤋᤧᤖᤥ.",{"text":"“ᤒᤧᤒᤡᤗᤥᤏᤡᤴ ᤔᤧᤃᤧᤖᤥ. ᤐᤕᤶ ᤕᤶᤒᤠ ᤕᤧᤰᤕᤰᤁᤡᤴ ᤔᤧᤃᤧᤖᤥ᥄ ᤂᤧᤴ ᤀᤠᤸᤗ ᤗᤣ᤺ᤳᤇᤠᤶ ᤑᤢᤱᤛᤠᤶ ᤏᤢ ᤑᤧᤴᤛᤠᤶᤜᤠ᤹ᤖᤧ ᤂᤢᤏᤡ᤹ ᤘᤠ᤹ᤔᤠ ᤋᤧᤴ ᤐᤥ᤺ᤰᤂᤧᤀᤠᤱ ᤘᤠ᤹॥ ᤂᤧᤵᤔᤥᤃ ᤁᤠᤰ ᤐᤖᤡᤰᤗᤧᤴ ᤛᤡᤰᤁᤧᤗᤧ᤺ᤱᤒᤠ ᤏᤢ ᤀᤠᤛᤢᤳᤌᤥ ᤐᤢᤜᤠ᤹ ᤕᤠᤱᤔᤧᤎᤥ᤺ᤰᤗᤥ॥","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"ᤌᤣᤀᤠᤱᤓᤧᤸᤗᤧ ᤀᤡᤰᤛᤠᤍᤡᤱ ᤂᤠᤶᤒᤣ᤺ᤰᤁᤥ ᤁᤧᤘᤠ᤹ᤒᤠ ᤁᤠᤰ ᤔᤧᤴᤇᤠᤶ ᤛᤢᤘᤠᤱᤜᤠ᤹ ᤁᤢᤕᤠᤶᤒᤥ᤺ᤵᤔᤠ ᤛᤡᤈᤱᤘᤠ᤺ᤸᤗᤧ ᤔᤕᤢᤛᤡ॥ ᤜᤧᤰᤁᤩᤠᤱ ᤀᤡᤰᤛᤠᤍᤡᤱ ᤂᤠᤶᤒᤣ᤺ᤰᤔᤥᤒᤠ ᤁᤠᤰ ᤜᤠᤱᤜᤠ᤹ᤖᤧ ᤂᤧᤴᤏᤢ ᤕᤠᤶᤒᤥ᤺ᤵᤔᤠ ᤕᤠ᤺ᤶᤒᤰ ᤔᤧᤈᤥᤃᤢ. ᤜᤧᤰᤁᤩᤠᤱ ᤂᤧᤸᤗᤧ ᤕᤠᤶᤍᤠᤍᤠ ᤏᤢ ᤏᤡᤱᤘᤠ᤹ᤋᤠᤍᤠᤒᤠ ᤁᤢᤜᤡᤱᤔᤴᤏᤡᤸᤗᤧ ᤆᤥᤃᤢᤸᤗᤧ ᤀᤡᤰᤛᤠᤍᤡᤱ ᤂᤠᤶᤒᤣ᤺ᤰᤔᤥᤒᤠ ᤗᤧᤱᤜᤱᤒᤠᤜᤠ᤹ ᤛᤠ᤹ᤖᤡᤰ ᤕᤠᤱᤛᤠᤁᤢᤴᤎᤣᤛᤠᤒᤠ ᤔᤧᤒᤥ᤺ᤰᤂᤧᤖᤥ॥”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["ᤜᤧᤰᤁᤩᤠᤱ ᤛᤠᤱᤃᤪᤠᤶᤐᤣᤍᤠᤱᤗᤠᤶ ᤘᤣ᤹ ᤀᤡᤰᤗᤠᤎᤡᤰ ᤂᤧᤵᤛᤢᤱᤗᤥ.",{"text":"“ᤀᤠ